  "description": "A Bulk-Solution-Manager tool for the XrmToolBox that can automatically export and import multiple solutions at a time. The tool supports manged- and unmanaged solution where each file is saved in its specific target location. Before updating, the solution's version number(s) can be updated according to a custom version format. Downloaded files can automatically be commited to a git repository.",
